window.docContents[72].resolve({"/Basic-Types/Arrays/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Arrays--Subarrays--Lookups":{"contents":"Extracts an element from the subarray.The index is relative to the start of the subarray, rather than the underlying array.\n\nExtracts an element from the subarray, or returns a default value when the index is out of bounds.The index is relative to the start and end of the subarray, rather than the underlying array. The\ndefault value is that provided by the Inhabited α instance.\n\nExtracts an element from the subarray, or returns a default value v₀ when the index is out of\nbounds.The index is relative to the start and end of the subarray, rather than the underlying array.\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Basic Types\u0009Arrays\u0009Subarrays","header":"20.16.5.3. Lookups","id":"/Basic-Types/Arrays/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Arrays--Subarrays--Lookups"},"/Build-Tools-and-Distribution/Lake/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Build-Tools-and-Distribution--Lake--Configuration-File-Format--Lean-Format--Targets":{"contents":"通常通过应用 default_target 属性将目标加入默认目标集合，而不是显式列出它们。\n\n\n\n指定默认目标将目标标记为默认目标，在未指定其他目标时构建。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009构建工具\u0009Lake\u0009配置文件格式\u0009Lean 格式","header":"24.1.3.2.4. 目标","id":"/Build-Tools-and-Distribution/Lake/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Build-Tools-and-Distribution--Lake--Configuration-File-Format--Lean-Format--Targets"},"/Interacting-with-Lean/#repr":{"contents":"Repr 实例描述如何将值表示为 Std.Format。\n因为它们应当发出有效的 Lean 语法，所以这些实例需要考虑优先级。\n插入最大数量的圆括号确实可行，但会使人类更难阅读所得输出。\n\n把某种类型的值转换为 Format 的标准方式。渲染所得 Format 后，结果应尽可能接近\n可以解析回输入值的文本。在给定优先级下把类型 α 的值转换为 Format。可利用优先级值避免不必要的圆括号。\n\n使用 a 的 Repr 实例将其转换为 Format，初始优先级为 0。\n\n使用 a 的 Repr 实例将其转换为 String，并以默认的 120 列宽度渲染 Format。\n初始优先级为 0。\n\n最多的圆括号类型 NatOrInt 可以包含一个 Nat 或一个 Int：inductive NatOrInt where\n  | nat : Nat → NatOrInt\n  | int : Int → NatOrInt\n这个 Repr NatOrInt 实例通过插入许多圆括号来确保输出是有效的 Lean 语法：instance : Repr NatOrInt where\n  reprPrec x _ :=\n    .nestD <| .group <|\n      match x with\n      | .nat n =>\n          .text \"(\" ++ \"NatOrInt.nat\" ++ .line ++ \"(\" ++ repr n ++ \"))\"\n      | .int i =>\n          .text \"(\" ++ \"NatOrInt.int\" ++ .line ++ \"(\" ++ repr i ++ \"))\"\n无论它包含 Nat、非负的 Int，还是负的 Int，结果都可以被解析：open NatOrInt in\n#eval do\n  IO.println <| repr <| nat 3\n  IO.println <| repr <| int 5\n  IO.println <| repr <| int (-5)\n(NatOrInt.nat (3))\n(NatOrInt.int (5))\n(NatOrInt.int (-5))\n不过，(NatOrInt.nat (3)) 并不是特别惯用的 Lean 写法，而且冗余的圆括号会使大型表达式难以阅读。\n\n方法 Repr.reprPrec 具有如下签名：\n\nRepr.reprPrec.{u} {α : Type u} [Repr α] : α → Nat → Std.Format\n\n\n第一个显式参数是要表示的值，第二个则是该值所在上下文的优先级。\n可以利用此优先级决定是否插入圆括号：如果实例所生成语法的优先级不高于其上下文的优先级，就需要圆括号。\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009与 Lean 交互\u0009格式化输出","header":"3.7.2. Repr","id":"/Interacting-with-Lean/#repr"}});